  "prompt": "Among the products launched on or after 1 January 2024, which 2 have the lowest unit cost? Return product_id, product_name and unit_cost_eur, in that order, with exactly these column names, cheapest first. When products tie on unit_cost_eur, the lower product_id comes first and wins the place. Products with no unit cost do not count, and neither do products with a missing launch_date. Return exactly 2 rows.",
